an></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8424em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5208em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9069em;vertical-align:-1.4763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.5237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">候选真实吸引力</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.202em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.798em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是槽位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 的<strong>位置偏置系数</strong>，其估计方法很简单：随机化展示（把候选随机打散到各槽位）一段时间，统计每个槽位的点击率相对第 1 槽的比值，就得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的估计。这个动作只需短暂开启（几小时到一天，取决于流量），且它的产物可以长期复用。把点击概率分解为位置因子与候选因子的建模方式与位置偏置模型的经典研究一脉相承（来源：Craswell, Zoeter, Taylor &amp; Ramsey, &quot;An Experimental Comparison of Click Position-Bias Models&quot;, WSDM 2008, <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1145/1341531.1341545\">https://doi.org/10.1145/1341531.1341545</a>）。有了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，就可以把观测点击率还原为候选的真实吸引力：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mtext>click</mtext><mi>c</mi></msub><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>impr</mtext><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{r}_c = \\frac{\\text{click}_c}{\\sum_k p_k \\cdot \\text{impr}_{c,k}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4377em;vertical-align:-1.0662em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">impr</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">click</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0662em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个校正后的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{r}_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 才可用于跨候选、跨版本的比较。<strong>它是排序模型训练标签的来源，也是离线回放能给出可信结论的前提。</strong></p>\n<p>一个实践要点：位置偏置系数<strong>按市场分别估计</strong>。移动端为主的市场与桌面端为主的市场，视线分布不同；RTL 语言市场的阅读顺序也不同（用户可能从右或从中间开始扫描）。用一个全局系数会让部分市场的校正系统性偏差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"a-b-实验与离线回放的分工\">A/B 实验与离线回放的分工</h2><p>两种验证手段，回答不同的问题，且都不能替代对方。</p>\n<p><strong>A/B 实验回答&quot;上线后是否真的更好&quot;。</strong> 它是唯一能给出因果结论的手段，因为它随机化了分流。三个建议特有的实验设计要点：分流单位应该是<strong>用户</strong>而非会话（会话级分流会让同一用户在两组间跳变，体验断裂且指标被污染）；实验必须观测<strong>至少一个完整的活跃周期</strong>（周末与工作日的搜索行为差异显著，跨境场景下还要覆盖各市场的时区）；指标要看<strong>成对指标</strong>（正向 + 反向）而不是单指标，理由已在前文说明。</p>\n<p><strong>离线回放回答&quot;如果上线会发生什么&quot;。</strong> 用历史日志（含特征快照）重放新排序函数，计算新排序下的候选与用户实际点击的一致性。它的优点是快（不用等流量）、成本低、可以同时评估多个版本；缺点是它只能评估<strong>已被曝光的候选</strong>——新排序可能想展示一条历史上从未出现在该位置的候选，而日志里没有它的反事实点击。因此离线回放的结论强度有限，它适合<strong>筛选候选版本</strong>（从十个版本里选出三个值得上线的），不适合<strong>做最终决策</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>周期</th>\n<th>主要局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>A/B 实验</td>\n<td>上线后是否更好（因果）</td>\n<td>1-3 周</td>\n<td>慢；需流量；风险承担</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>离线回放</td>\n<td>多个版本哪个更值得试</td>\n<td>小时-天</td>\n<td>无法评估未曝光候选（反事实缺失）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人工评审</td>\n<td>语义质量是否合理</td>\n<td>小时</td>\n<td>不反映真实行为；样本小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>影子流量</td>\n<td>新链路是否可工作、延迟如何</td>\n<td>天</td>\n<td>只能测可用性与性能，测不出质量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第四行（影子流量）常被忽略但很重要：新索引或新链路在<strong>不影响线上</strong>的前提下走真实流量、只记录不返回，可以验证可用性与延迟，以及&quot;新索引是否会在某些前缀上返回空&quot;。它是上线前的最后一道工程检查，与质量度量是两个不同维度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"负反馈与质量监控\">负反馈与质量监控</h2><p>正向指标下降需要几小时到几天才被察觉（业务有周期性波动，单点下降难以判定），而负反馈是<strong>即时、明确、低成本</strong>的信号：用户在候选上标记&quot;这条不对&quot;，或在候选上停留后清空输入重打。后者的自动检测（<code>event_type=5 abandon</code>）尤其有价值——<strong>用户清空输入并重新输入不同内容，说明他的第一次输入被系统误导了</strong>。</p>\n<p>负反馈的三种用法：</p>\n<p><strong>候选级黑名单。</strong> 某条候选的负反馈率超过阈值时从候选池移除（或进入人工审核队列）。这是最直接的用法，代价是需要防止被恶意刷（单个用户的负反馈不能直接触发移除，需要一定数量的独立用户）。</p>\n<p><strong>前缀级质量监控。</strong> 汇总负反馈率最高的前缀，它们指向系统性的候选质量问题（例如某个品类的候选全是同一类，或者某个前缀下所有候选都是零结果）。这是<a href=\"zero-result-prevention\">用建议预防零结果搜索</a>防护策略的输入。</p>\n<p><strong>全局健康度。</strong> 负反馈率与放弃率作为建议服务的两个&quot;红线指标&quot;，超过阈值时触发告警并考虑回滚最近的变更。它们的价值在于<strong>响应快</strong>——不需要等统计显著性，趋势变化就足以发出信号。</p>\n<p>最后一条实践建议：<strong>把质量指标与工程指标放在同一个看板上</strong>。延迟（p50/p99）、索引版本、缓存命中率、边缘回源比例，与采纳率、零结果率、负反馈率放一起，是因为它们经常一起变化——一次索引分发异常会同时让回源比例上升、延迟上升、采纳率下降。分开看两个看板会把一次故障看成两个无关的问题（<a href=\"../low-latency/edge-suggest\">边缘节点建议加速</a>里已经指出这一点）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>建议的&quot;好&quot;有三个互相冲突的定义，任何单一指标都能被优化到失真；必须成对看正向指标（点击率、采纳率、采纳后转化率）与反向指标（零结果率、放弃率、负反馈率）。</li>\n<li>三种采纳口径分层使用：采纳率（口径二）是日常调优主指标；采纳后转化率样本稀疏，只用于阶段验证；CTR 只作诊断（看它与采纳率的落差）。</li>\n<li>埋点必须携带位置、来源与特征快照、归一化去重键三类上下文；缺任何一类都有指标算不出来或算不准。</li>\n<li>事件表要落 <code>model_ver</code> 与 <code>index_ver</code>：排查质量突变看的是版本号与指标突变时间的关系，而不是猜。</li>\n<li>原始点击率不能跨候选、跨版本比较，必须先做位置偏差校正（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>click</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{click}) = p_k \\cdot r_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">click</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）；位置偏置系数用短时随机化展示估计，并按市场分别估计。</li>\n<li>A/B 实验是唯一的因果证据，分流单位用用户、观测完整活跃周期、指标看成对；离线回放用于筛选候选版本，无法评估未曝光候选（反事实缺失）；影子流量用于上线前的可用性与延迟验证。</li>\n<li>负反馈的三种用法：候选级黑名单（需防恶意刷）、前缀级质量监控、全局健康度红线；它的价值在于响应快，不需要等统计显著性。</li>\n<li>质量指标与工程指标必须放在同一看板上，因为一次索引或分发故障会让它们同时变化。</li>\n<li>相关阅读：排序函数与其特征见<a href=\"suggest-ranking\">建议词排序：热度、个性化与转化</a>；防护动作的审计见<a href=\"zero-result-prevention\">用建议预防零结果搜索</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"建议点击与采纳效果分析：指标、归因与偏差校正","id":"建议点击与采纳效果分析-指标-归因与偏差校正"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三种采纳口径与它们各自的谎言","id":"核心概念-三种采纳口径与它们各自的谎言"},{"level":2,"text":"埋点：三个必须携带的上下文","id":"埋点-三个必须携带的上下文"},{"level":2,"text":"位置偏差：为什么原始 CTR 不能直接比较","id":"位置偏差-为什么原始-ctr-不能直接比较"},{"level":2,"text":"A/B 实验与离线回放的分工","id":"a-b-实验与离线回放的分工"},{"level":2,"text":"负反馈与质量监控","id":"负反馈与质量监控"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"用建议预防零结果搜索：把漏斗泄漏挡在提交之前","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-autocomplete-suggestion/quality-zero-result/zero-result-prevention"},"next":null}